# Rank 2 Mission 2 (battlefield.rank_2_mission_2): San d'Orian helpers who finished 2-3 or Journey Abroad. Three level
# 75 Warriors of San d'Oria: main with Journey to Bastok (the second) current at Status 10 and the Dark Key (the
# registrant), eve with Journey Abroad (San d'Oria 5) and Journey to Bastok (the second) completed, fay with Journey
# Abroad completed (GMs). main leads eve and fay; main's menu, area 1: registered, eve and fay registered with it;
# main enters. eve with the clearance: entryRequirement as no registrant: hasCompletedMission(nation 0, 5) (Journey
# Abroad): nonRegistrantReqs: the menu (enterExisting 1). eve's update for area 2: registerBattlefield finds eve's
# registration (area 1), not the area asked: INCREMENT_REQUEST, answered as WAIT (0x05C [1]); area 1: entered.
# checkSkipCutscene: 2-3 completed (its San d'Oria hasCompletedMission operand): true, but updateEvent keeps only
# number params, so the boolean never reaches the 0x05C (eve's update reads as a non-skippable one). fay with the
# clearance: the menu (enterExisting 1), no update yet. main claims Dark_Dragon: LOCKED; onBattlefieldStatusChange
# takes the clearance from fay, outside. fay's update for area 2: no clearance, EnterExisting 1, registered in area
# 1, another area asked: WAIT (EnterExisting kept); for area 1: LOCKED (0x05C [4]). The pair killed (Dark_Dragon's
# onMobDeath: its title to all three, fay outside too): no crate: the cutscene timer 5, WON; at the fifth tick the
# cleanup: 32001 (battlefieldWin 64; a plain Battlefield: no canSkipCS) to main and eve. main's finish:
# San d'Oria 2-3's handler: the Kindred Crest, the Dark Key taken, Status 11. eve's finish: 2-3 is not current: no
# 2-3 section: nothing. No RNG dependency; the 32001 tick is the timer's (see #sandoria).
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char fay zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
keyitem DarkKey
eve: mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad completed
eve: mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 completed
fay: mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad completed
login
missionstatus Sandoria 10               # a GM
eve: login
fay: login
invite eve
eve: accept
invite fay
fay: accept
trigger BC_Entrance                     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered; eve and fay registered with it; main entered
finish                                  # in arena 1
eve: trigger BC_Entrance                # the clearance, Journey Abroad completed: the menu (enterExisting)
eve: update 32000 option=2              # registered in area 1, area 2 asked: INCREMENT_REQUEST: WAIT
eve: update 32000 option=1              # area 1: entered
eve: finish                             # in arena 1
fay: trigger BC_Entrance                # the clearance: the menu (enterExisting)
tick 2000                               # Dark_Dragon and Seeker spawn
claim #17367041                         # Dark_Dragon: LOCKED; the clearance taken from fay
tick 1000
fay: update 32000 option=2              # registered in area 1, area 2 asked: WAIT
fay: update 32000 option=1              # area 1, locked: LOCKED
fay: finish
kill #17367041                          # Dark_Dragon
kill #17367042                          # Seeker: allDeath: no crate: the cutscene timer 5, WON
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000                               # the timer out: the cleanup: 32001 to main and eve
tick 2000                               # nothing more
finish                                  # 2-3: the Kindred Crest, the Dark Key taken, Status 11
eve: finish                             # eve: 2-3 not current: nothing
